---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
import {Video} from "accessible-astro-components" 
---

<Layout title="Christmas 2026" description="Father Christmas letter from John Antzoulis for the year 2026">
	<main class="prose-lg md:prose-2xl flex flex-col items-center w-full max-w-4xl p-10 mx-auto mt-10">
		<h1 >Dear Father Christmas</h1>
		<p>Yearly, around late October early November, expectations start to rise, and you, as an almighty super-natural entity, begin to ask yourself: <strong> What should I get for Johnny this year? </strong> </p>
		<h2>Well, Im here to answer that exact question: <span class="text-blue-600">A Google Pixel 10</span></h2>
		<video
			src="https://storage.googleapis.com/mannequin/blobs/ff10f122-2435-422c-bd9c-10aa1da12d93.webm"
			title="Google Pixel 10 promotional video"
			class="aspect-video w-full "
			autoplay
			muted
			loop
			playsinline
		></video>
		<p>Ideally it would be a <span class="text-blue-600">BLUE</span> Pixel 10, but I know the economy is rough this year. With climate change the primary export of the North Pole <span class="line-through">reindeer poop</span> is under minimums, so I would understand if instead of a Pixel 10 is a <strong>Pixel 10a</strong> which is cheaper. As far as the color goes, I really like the blue one of both models, but it isn't a priority, if another color is cheaper I'm fine with it.</p>
		<h2>Why the Pixel 10 and not the <span class="text-red-600">11</span>?</h2>
		<p>The Pixel 11 is <strong>NOT</strong> compatible with <a href="https://grapheneos.org/" class="underline text-blue-600">GrapheneOS</a>, which is a bummer. The team from GrapheneOS says the new model from this year ships with less security features compared to the Pixel 10, and they are not sure if the operating system will be released for the new phones as it doesn't meet their standards.</p> 

		<p>I would provide links for both phones but with the volatility of the market I think the best course of action would be for you to search for the best offer <span class="line-through">mediamarkt usually has the better prices</span>.</p>

		<p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl">With my very kindest regards: John Antzoulis</p>


	</main>
	
</Layout>